Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Header,,0,0,0,,This is a Gentlemen of the Hàn free fansub.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:07.60,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,6200,6450)\pos(640,371.2)}\N\N\N\N\N\NEpisode 52\N\N\N\N\NThe Seizure of the Western Riverlands
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.50,0:00:34.75,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Ma Chao of Western Liang, owing to the murder of his father by Cao Cao
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.75,0:00:37.00,Thinking,,0,0,0,,and losing most of his troops,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.00,0:00:43.30,Thinking,,0,0,0,,had no choice but to seek asylum from Zhang Lu for the time being.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.45,0:00:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,They call him "Brocade Ma Chao."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.62,0:00:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He is as handsome and poised as brocade.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.05,0:00:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,A well-deserved reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.90,0:00:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother, don't stoke another person's prestige.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.50,0:00:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go down the pass to fight Ma Chao!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.67,0:00:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Third Brother, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.27,0:01:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma Chao is still vigorous.\NWe should avoid his force for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.44,0:01:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to deflate his ego!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.90,0:01:09.98,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(969.333,506.667)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,1700,2160)}Liú Bèi \NStyled: Xuándé
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.05,0:01:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Third Brother, do not be reckless.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.30,0:01:12.98,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(410.667,506.667)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,2350,2660)}Zhāng Fēi\NStyled: Yìdé
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.99,0:01:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang Fei, come down the pass if you have the guts!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.84,0:01:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Fight a hundred bouts with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.72,0:01:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma Chao challenges me, but I sit here idling!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.58,0:01:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely you are not afraid of him?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.86,0:01:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Third Brother, do not be impatient. I have a winning plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.68,0:01:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Come.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.06,0:01:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang Fei, since you dare not come fight me,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.19,0:01:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,why not open up the pass and surrender?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.22,0:01:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I will be merciful.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.28,0:01:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang Fei, do not be afraid!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.86,0:01:46.42,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(984,514.286)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,2260,2580)}Mǎ Chāo \NStyled: Mèngqǐ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.64,0:01:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Will the hero of Changban slope dare come down and fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.56,0:01:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I have been waiting for quite a long time!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.43,0:02:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Third Brother, come.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.43,0:02:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang Fei, I will not return to my camp without a fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.17,0:02:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Third Brother, you may now go fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.82,0:02:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.34,0:02:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.45,0:02:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,His martial prowess is extraordinary. You must be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.50,0:02:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not let your guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.87,0:02:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother, rest assured.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.22,0:02:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to engage!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.66,0:03:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Engage in the crescent formation!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.18,0:03:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma Chao, you curr, do you recognize Zhang Yide of Yan?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.94,0:03:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,My family is of noble pedigree. \NHow can I recognize a nobody from the countryside?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.68,0:03:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Cocky bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.79,0:03:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on then!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.37,0:03:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.55,0:03:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Come!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.11,0:04:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Come!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.74,0:04:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,General Zhang! General Zhang!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.06,0:04:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,General Ma! General Ma!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.88,0:04:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,General Zhang!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.92,0:05:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Dauntless Ma Chao is truly a tiger-like general of our time!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.52,0:05:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,General Ma! General Ma!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.36,0:05:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,General Zhang! General Zhang!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.67,0:06:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Imperial Uncle,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.94,0:06:59.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,they have fought over two hundred bouts without a victor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.73,0:07:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I fear that with two tigers fighting, one will wound up injured!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.12,0:07:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Ring the bell to withdraw.\N-Yes sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.64,0:07:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother, please dismount and rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.90,0:07:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang Fei is no ordinary man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.01,0:07:35.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Ever since I began my campaigns with Father,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.41,0:07:37.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,never have I met such an opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.88,0:07:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother, I was on a spree!\NWhy did you ring the bell?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.04,0:07:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He was truly mighty. I worried \Nyou could have been hurt, thus I rung the bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.74,0:07:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You are too cautious!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.05,0:07:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Had I fought a couple more rounds, \NI would have dismounted Ma Chao!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.34,0:07:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.98,0:07:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma Chao hurting you would be unacceptable,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.96,0:08:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,but you hurting him is not my wish either.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.63,0:08:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma Chao is a tiger general of our time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.41,0:08:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,If he surrendered, he would really help us in taking\N the Western Riverlands and fulfilling my work.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.30,0:08:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother, you're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.75,0:08:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't hurt him. I'll just capture him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.21,0:08:26.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Third Brother, it is getting late.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.91,0:08:29.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,It is not too late to go rest for the night to fight tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.32,0:08:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no. I still need to capture him. How can I rest?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.25,0:08:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The sun is setting westwards and night is coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.82,0:08:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Command the soldiers to light torches and arrange a night battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.09,0:08:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Third Brother, how impatient you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.06,0:08:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang Fei!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.18,0:08:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you dare fight at night?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.90,0:08:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If you do, light the torches and let us fight it out tonight!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.13,0:08:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, then! Unless you fear you will lose?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.94,0:08:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Third Brother, how can you be so rash?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.88,0:08:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Light the torches!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.21,0:09:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma Chao!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.48,0:09:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not go back to the pass unless I capture you today!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.54,0:09:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang Yide!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.76,0:09:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not go back to the camp unless I kill you today!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.37,0:09:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.48,0:09:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,General Ma! General Ma!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.27,0:09:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,General Zhang! General Zhang!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.57,0:10:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,General Zhang!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.50,0:11:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.28,0:11:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma Chao, let's see where you're going now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.74,0:12:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,General Ma! General Ma!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.44,0:12:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,General Zhang! General Zhang!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.10,0:13:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,General Zhang won! General Zhang won!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.48,0:13:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,General Ma won! General Ma won!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.62,0:13:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma Chao!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.97,0:13:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want your helmet?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.17,0:13:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang Yide, do you want your headscarf?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.05,0:13:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma Chao, your head is here. Do you dare come get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.25,0:13:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang Yide, your head is here! Do you dare come get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.44,0:13:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Ring the bell to withdraw.\N-Yes! Ring the bell!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.89,0:14:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma Chao, we will stop fighting for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.63,0:14:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Go back with your troops to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.00,0:14:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I always treat people with kindness\N and I would not scheme against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.15,0:14:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not chase you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.98,0:14:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine. We will fight again tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.02,0:14:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Put out the torches. Move back to the camp!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.20,0:14:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother! Elder Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.64,0:14:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.98,0:14:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Why aren't you up?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.73,0:14:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to fight Ma Chao for five hundred bouts today!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.24,0:14:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You two fought day and night yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.50,0:14:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You still came out even after\N six or seven hundred bouts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.88,0:14:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,When will you stop if you keep on fighting?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.46,0:14:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Rest for a couple days and let me think it through.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.37,0:14:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,With the winner undecided, how can I rest, Elder Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.72,0:14:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The Strategos is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.02,0:14:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry and let him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.44,0:15:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord.\NStrategos.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.11,0:15:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You must have come because you are worrying\N about the fight between Yide and Ma Chao.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.81,0:15:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma Chao is a tiger general of our time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.29,0:15:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Sit, sit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.72,0:15:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I fear that with two tigers fighting, one will wound up injured!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.72,0:15:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Moreover, after you saw Ma Chao for yourself, \Nyou would take a liking to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.70,0:15:25.02,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(341.715,488)\fade(255,0,255,0,350,3940,4300)}Zhūgě Liàng \NStyled: Kǒngmíng
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.56,0:15:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That is why I had Zilong and Hansheng \Ndefend Mianzhu for me to come here overnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.97,0:15:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,If so, do you have a way to make Ma Chao surrender?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.65,0:15:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord understands me, clearly!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.53,0:15:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a strategy that shall make Ma Chao surrender without force.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.58,0:15:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.20,0:15:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma Chao is brave and gallant, and I see great value in him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.39,0:15:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What stratagem do you have? Please inform me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.73,0:16:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909}I heard that Zhang Lu wants to make himself "King of Hanning."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.40,0:16:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(635.455,662.073)}{\bord10.909}His strategist, Yang Song, {\pos(635.455,657.273)}{\bord10.909}is greedy and envious.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.86,0:16:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909}You should send a man to Hanzhong through a small path.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.42,0:16:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(635.455,662.073)}{\bord10.909}First, befriend Yang Song through gold and silver.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.01,0:16:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(635.455,662.073)}{\bord10.909}Then, write a letter to Zhang Lu,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.02,0:16:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909}claim that your struggle against Liu Zhang for the Riverlands is to avenge Zhang Lu.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.89,0:16:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909}Sway him to ignore words that sow discord among us,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.53,0:16:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(635.455,662.073)}{\bord10.909}and to order Ma Chao to retreat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.29,0:16:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(635.455,662.073)}{\bord10.909}Wait for the retreat,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.14,0:16:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(635.455,662.073)}{\bord10.909}then use a strategy to make Ma Chao surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.87,0:16:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What a great stratagem! What a great stratagem!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.77,0:16:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall draft a letter ordering Sun Qian to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.38,0:16:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a gesture of goodwill from my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.47,0:16:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Good. Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.74,0:16:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I will take care of this matter,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.58,0:16:56.54,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(985,496)\fade(255,0,255,0,350,2620,2940)}Yáng Sōng
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.94,0:16:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,but tell Imperial Uncle Liu not to \Ngo back on his word after my deed is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.34,0:17:02.18,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(310.667,441.333)}Sūn Qián \NStyled: Gōngyòu
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.65,0:17:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Rest assured.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.22,0:17:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It has been over half a month \Nsince my intense fight with Zhang Fei.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.38,0:17:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I have challenged them many times,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.44,0:17:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,but Liu Bei is staying put in the pass and I do not know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.66,0:17:20.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I heard that Zhuge Liang is a wise strategist.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.09,0:17:22.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,What if there is a ruse?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.93,0:17:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if there is a ruse, why should I fear it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.58,0:17:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,If they do not sally forth tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.32,0:17:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I will raise all troops in the camp to attack the pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.73,0:17:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,General, General!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.60,0:17:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Our lord's messenger is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.17,0:17:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.92,0:17:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.50,0:17:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord has ordered me to lead the troops back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.82,0:17:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is he ordering me to retreat without any success?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.01,0:17:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I come by his order. I do not know the reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.59,0:18:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Please reply that I cannot go back without making any progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.18,0:18:06.10,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(331.429,509.714)\fade(255,0,255,0,450,1580,1900)}Zhāng Lǔ \NStyled: Gōngqí
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.13,0:18:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,How bold and reckless!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.26,0:18:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma Chao was always untrue, acting out against us at his whim.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.52,0:18:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You have sent messengers with your orders thrice to him,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.82,0:18:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,but he dares ignore them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.71,0:18:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It is evident that he intends to rebel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.48,0:18:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, regarding Ma Chao's request to go,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.38,0:18:26.54,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(441.144,422.857)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,1820,2140)}Yáng Bǎi
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.85,0:18:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe his intention is to use \Nyour troops to take the Western Riverlands,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.73,0:18:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,make himself the King of Shu, and avenge his father.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.61,0:18:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,How does he have any intention of serving my Lord?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.85,0:18:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.42,0:18:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Worry not, my lord. I am willing to ride there,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.96,0:18:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,find out what he is planning, then plan accordingly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.00,0:18:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Do just that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.57,0:18:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,When I led a large army here,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.95,0:18:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to serve Zhang Lu,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.52,0:18:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,but he has urged me to withdraw \Nwhen I was about to kill a general and attack the pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.65,0:19:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This is outrageous!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.34,0:19:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang Lu is such a fatuous and incapable man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.75,0:19:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He even believes that he can control me at his whim too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.09,0:19:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother, we have no place to stay\N right now, and we still need to bide our time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.74,0:19:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,His abrupt repeated orders to withdraw
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.86,0:19:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,must be due to libels against us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.11,0:19:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It has to be the brothers Yang Song and Yang Bai!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.62,0:19:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,They are greedy and jealous of talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.76,0:19:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,General.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.47,0:19:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategist Yang Song is outside the tent.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.79,0:19:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother, Elder Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.99,0:19:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,General Ma!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.66,0:19:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, it has been an arduous journey. Why not enter the tent and rest?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.24,0:19:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I just love seeing the scenery of your army.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.69,0:20:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.63,0:20:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Yang, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.58,0:20:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What has the lord said?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.50,0:20:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He only sent me to urge you to withdraw.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.04,0:20:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And if I don't withdraw,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.35,0:20:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,what then?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.26,0:20:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It is okay for you not to withdraw,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.86,0:20:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,but you must accomplish three tasks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.60,0:20:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What three tasks?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.17,0:20:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, the first one is to defeat the army from Jing province.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.46,0:20:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That is why I came here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.64,0:20:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What is the next one?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.88,0:20:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Take the head of Liu Zhang.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.42,0:20:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The third one is to conquer the Western Riverlands.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.61,0:20:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.29,0:20:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I have only twenty thousand troops!\N How can I take the Western Riverlands?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.28,0:21:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,General, this is none of my concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.79,0:21:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,These are my lord's orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.64,0:21:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,If these three tasks can be done \Nin one month, it is fine to not withdraw.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.89,0:21:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If even one is missed, then-
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.62,0:21:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.14,0:21:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you must give up your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.24,0:21:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This is absurd!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.31,0:21:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma Chao had no choice but to retreat to Hanzhong.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.16,0:21:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yang Song then ordered men to spread rumors,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.78,0:21:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,claiming that Ma Chao returned \Nin order to seize Hanzhong in one fell swoop.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.44,0:21:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang Lu hurriedly ordered his younger brother, Zhang Wei,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.08,0:21:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,to split his troops into seven parts to hold each chokepoint
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.20,0:21:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,so as to prevent any of Ma Chao's troops from entering.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.72,0:21:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma Chao cannot advance or withdraw.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.61,0:21:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He has nowhere to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.88,0:22:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongyou has made a great accomplishment in his trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.10,0:22:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma Chao is now at an impasse.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.49,0:22:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I will personally talk to him about his situation,\N then he will gladly come and surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.40,0:22:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You are going? Do not do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.39,0:22:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma Chao is a brutish man. He is arrogant and hot in temper.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.50,0:22:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you take such a risk and go?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.36,0:22:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You cannot do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.62,0:22:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed, as Ma Chao is arrogant and irritable,\N it will be difficult to convince him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.85,0:22:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,One must be quick-witted and good with words.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.63,0:22:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It is difficult to find a man\N who is suitable for this task right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.95,0:22:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at all! Not at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.65,0:22:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, Strategos.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.82,0:22:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Escorted by Zilong, Li Hui of the Riverlands is surrendering.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.09,0:23:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I know this fellow urged Liu Zhang \Nto refuse your entry into the Riverlands.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.12,0:23:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Now his own entry will be very beneficial to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.73,0:23:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry and invite him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.98,0:23:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I, Li Hui, come to your tent to render my service.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.64,0:23:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I am blessed by your regard and covet it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.72,0:23:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.20,0:23:27.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I heard that you warned against me to Liu Zhang.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.10,0:23:29.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I wonder why you are surrendering now?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.72,0:23:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909}A good bird picks the tree to roost;\N {\bord10.909}an able subject picks the lord to serve.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.46,0:23:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(635.455,669.545)}{\bord10.909}My bitter warning to Liu Zhang
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.22,0:23:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(635.455,669.545)}{\bord10.909}was made to fulfill my duty as a subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.64,0:23:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(635.455,669.545)}{\bord10.909}As he ignored me, I knew that he would fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.89,0:23:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(635.455,669.545)}{\bord10.909}Today, your virtue has spread across the land of Shu.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.26,0:23:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909}Knowing that your endeavor \Nwill be successful, I come to surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.36,0:23:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What a direct man with direct words you are, De'ang.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.82,0:23:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You must have something \Nto teach me for your present visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.70,0:23:59.78,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(979.429,491.429)}Lǐ Huī \NStyled: Dé'áng
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.11,0:23:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I come to convince Ma Chao to surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.42,0:24:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,This must be aid from Heaven and the divine spirits!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.12,0:24:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I met once with Ma Chao at Longxi in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.77,0:24:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, I hear that he is at an impasse.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.70,0:24:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I am willing to go to his camp\N and persuade him to surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.17,0:24:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What sort of words are you \Nplanning to use to convince Ma Chao?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.35,0:24:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Li Hui is a renowned debater.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.86,0:24:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He is only coming here to influence me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.50,0:24:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I will signal you all by throwing my cup. \NThen, rush out and chop him into minced meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.88,0:24:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.21,0:24:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Enter, Li Hui!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.15,0:25:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Who forged this sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.29,0:25:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,How is the blade?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.28,0:25:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Li Hui is coming in.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.35,0:25:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Mengqi, how do you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.40,0:25:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.71,0:25:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I am here to influence you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.93,0:25:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The sword in my sheath had just been sharpened.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.39,0:25:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Speak if you want to,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.98,0:26:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,but if you can't convince me,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.91,0:26:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,then please test this sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.42,0:26:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,General, you are oblivious to the danger you are in.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.30,0:26:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps this sharp sword cannot be tested on my head
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.15,0:26:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,but be left aside to be tested on yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.18,0:26:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What danger am I in?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.86,0:26:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(635.455,665.509)}{\bord10.909}For Xi Shi of Yue,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.86,0:26:39.94,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Xī Shī (西施): One of the Four Ancient Beauties in the state of Yue.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.40,0:26:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(635.455,665.509)}{\bord10.909}those who could disfigure could not do it to her beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.14,0:26:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(635.455,665.509)}{\bord10.909}For Wuyan of Qi,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.14,0:26:44.16,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Wúyán (无鹽): A woman from the state of Qi famed for her ugliness.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.78,0:26:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909}those who could beautify could not do it to her ugliness.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.61,0:26:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909}The Sun rises before setting; \Nthe Moon waxes before waning.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.82,0:26:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(635.455,665.509)}{\bord10.909}This is the natural order of the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.08,0:26:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(635.455,665.509)}{\bord10.909}How can you not know this?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.38,0:27:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(635.455,665.509)}{\bord10.909}So what if I know it? What if I do not know it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.63,0:27:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909}You have a nemesis in\N Cao Cao for your father's death;
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.44,0:27:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(635.455,665.509)}{\bord10.909}you have nemeses in the rebel generals of Longxi.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.89,0:27:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(635.455,665.509)}{\bord10.909}As for your front, you cannot reinforce Liu Zhang
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.37,0:27:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(635.455,665.509)}{\bord10.909}and repel the troops of Jing province.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.45,0:27:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909}As for your rear, you cannot \Nrein in Yang Song and see Zhang Lu.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.44,0:27:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(635.455,665.509)}{\bord10.909}Thus, you are a pariah within the Four Seas
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.47,0:27:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(635.455,665.509)}{\bord10.909}and you are between a rock and a hard place.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.63,0:27:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909}Can I ask you whether \Nit is a fortune or it is a hardship?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.92,0:27:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909} Your family is of noble stock, \Nyet now you've fallen to this,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.50,0:27:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909}unable to honor your forebears, nor protect your own kindred.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.84,0:28:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909}Suppose if we also consider, \Nthe loss of Ji city,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.28,0:28:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(635.455,665.509)}{\bord10.909}and the defeat at Wei-bridge,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.00,0:28:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909}then let me ask, sir, \Nhow will you face the people of the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.20,0:27:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.33,0:28:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, you are quite right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.07,0:28:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish to hear your advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.57,0:28:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,If you actually wanted to hear my advice,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.99,0:28:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,why this arrangement of arms in and out of the tent?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.09,0:28:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand down.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.70,0:28:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.98,0:29:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I ask you to point me in the right direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.84,0:29:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,General, you are a hero of our time.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.42,0:29:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet, you obey Zhang Lu, wasting your talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.78,0:29:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What a pity!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.07,0:29:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Liu Xuande is not just the Imperial Uncle, \Nhe esteems people of talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.90,0:29:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He will accomplish great deeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.60,0:29:23.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The reason I left Liu Zhang and \Nsurrendered to Imperial Uncle Liu
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.94,0:29:25.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,is because of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.31,0:29:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I only surrendered to Zhang Lu to find a place to stay
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.86,0:29:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,so that I may avenge my father later.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.82,0:29:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.21,0:29:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,General, you covet to\N avenge your father and brothers,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.72,0:29:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,so who is your enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.72,0:29:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Cao Cao!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.06,0:29:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Who in the world can challenge the traitor Cao?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.50,0:29:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Only Imperial Uncle Liu!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.82,0:29:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,How can that be done by\N the likes of Liu Zhang and Zhang Lu?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.94,0:30:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Moreover, your esteemed father planned\N to attack Cao Cao with Imperial Uncle Liu.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.51,0:30:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Why have you forgotten the Edict in the Belt incident?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.87,0:30:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Should your esteemed father's spirit \Nknow that you are attacking Liu Bei,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.20,0:30:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,how could his heart be at ease?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.74,0:30:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hearing your earnest words is like moving clouds \Nto see the sun: a sudden enlightenment.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.88,0:30:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.46,0:30:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,However what?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.62,0:30:47.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,However, I offended the honor of the Imperial Uncle's\N army by fighting to the death with Zhang Yide.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.08,0:30:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You are overthinking it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.12,0:30:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The characters of Imperial Uncle Liu \Nand Strategos Zhuge Liang
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.39,0:30:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,are not at all what you are perceiving them as.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.09,0:31:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.43,0:31:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The words Mister Li spoke are right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.46,0:31:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother De'ang, please reply to Imperial Uncle
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.92,0:31:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,that I will make preparations \Nand set off with my forces tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.29,0:31:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,General Ma, I had offended you much.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.41,0:32:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.72,0:32:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,General Zhang, please pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.11,0:32:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Sire, Liu Bei's army is coming to Chengdu!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.37,0:32:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,His vanguard is near the eastern gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.98,0:32:29.90,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(311,510)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,2620,2900)}Liú Zhāng \NStyled: Jìyù
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.62,0:32:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That-
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.00,0:32:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord! I report from the northern gate! Ma Chao's reinforcements arrived!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.53,0:32:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry! Hurry and go to the northern gate with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.30,0:32:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you General Ma Chao?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.80,0:32:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.14,0:32:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I had thought of reinforcing\N Yi province under Zhang Lu's orders,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.68,0:33:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,but Zhang Lu has been deceived\N and he intends to harm me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.96,0:33:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I am now a vanguard\N in the service of Imperial Uncle Liu.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.79,0:33:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the gates and many lives\N can be spared from suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.53,0:33:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,If you remain obstinate, once the walls \Nare breached, everyone in it will burn!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.50,0:33:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.20,0:33:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord! My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.48,0:33:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,How foolish I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.00,0:33:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,At this point,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.18,0:33:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,only by opening the gates and surrendering
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.42,0:33:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,can I spare my people from unnecessary suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.88,0:33:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.64,0:33:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.43,0:33:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,There are still thirty thousand soldiers in the city
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.34,0:33:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,and we have enough supplies and money for a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.86,0:33:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We swear to protect you and fight Liu Bei!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.98,0:34:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.94,0:34:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We can still fight. Do not surrender!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.89,0:34:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord! My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.84,0:34:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909}My father and I ruled in\N the land of Shu for twenty or so years.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.32,0:34:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(635.455,665.509)}{\bord10.909}with nary a benefit to its people.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.02,0:34:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909}Three years of endless war, \Nwhile the dead mount up,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.84,0:34:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(635.455,665.509)}{\bord10.909}all of this is my doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.90,0:34:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(635.455,665.509)}{\bord10.909}Surrender is but a stain upon my name alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.20,0:34:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909}To fight is to send the people \Nof the city into oblivion.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.76,0:34:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(635.455,665.509)}{\bord10.909}My heart would not be at peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.82,0:34:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, do not surrender, do not surrender!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.11,0:35:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I have been an official for half my life,\N but I have never held authority on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.61,0:35:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, I shall have my own view for once!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.68,0:35:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.58,0:35:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen, please say no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.68,0:35:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the gates.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.70,0:35:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the gates!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.32,0:35:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord! My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.06,0:36:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I, Liu Zhang, hereby surrender with my people.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.46,0:36:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I only hope that you, on account of our kinship,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.15,0:36:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,show leniency to my officials
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.26,0:36:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,and comfort the people in the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.56,0:36:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Jiyu.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.06,0:36:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Why must you say such words when we are kin?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.62,0:36:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,With matters coming to this point,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.42,0:36:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,those words are not my wish as your older brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.44,0:36:55.38,Thinking,,0,0,0,,In the 19th year of the Jian'an era (214 CE),
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.38,0:36:58.75,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Liu Bei took over Chengdu \Nand became Potentate of Yi Province,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.75,0:37:01.98,Thinking,,0,0,0,,settling Liu Zhang at Gong'an, Nan Commandery.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.98,0:37:06.33,Thinking,,0,0,0,,He rewarded officials, opened granaries \Nto the people, and reformed various laws.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.33,0:37:09.28,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Then, he gradually pacified forty-one commanderies,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.28,0:37:15.28,Thinking,,0,0,0,,setting the foundation of Shu-Han,\None of the three parts of the realm under heaven.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Header,,0,0,0,,Track 1

